<main id="main"><div class="page-content" id="ontology-page"><div class="page-section" id="ont-hero"><section class="hero"><div class="copy"><div class="eyebrow">ONTOLOGY ACCELERATOR</div><h1>Don't Start Your Ontology With a Blank Page.</h1><div class="sub">Start with what your enterprise is already telling you.</div><div class="body">RE-ViVE uses observed execution evidence to rapidly establish relationships across business processes, systems and supporting technology—giving ontology initiatives a practical foundation to validate and expand.</div><div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="/article-capital-markets-ontology-accelerator">See the Capital Markets use case</a></div></div><div class="visual"><svg aria-label="Fragmented enterprise evidence organizing into connected context" role="img" viewbox="0 0 920 700"><defs><marker id="arrow" markerheight="8" markerwidth="8" orient="auto" refx="7" refy="3"><path d="M0,0 L0,6 L7,3 z" fill="#9AA3B2"></path></marker></defs><path class="land-line" d="M82 106 C170 82 238 115 310 166"></path><path class="land-line" d="M82 106 C112 185 147 218 216 254"></path><path class="land-line" d="M216 254 C272 246 312 228 366 213"></path><path class="land-line2" d="M128 398 C196 362 252 389 326 430"></path><path class="land-line" d="M128 398 C218 454 271 483 354 510"></path><path class="land-line" d="M203 584 C300 548 359 514 420 454"></path><path class="land-line2" d="M638 118 C736 141 785 184 823 246"></path><path class="land-line" d="M693 309 C755 289 815 312 866 357"></path><path class="land-line" d="M701 520 C780 497 835 456 860 412"></path><path class="land-line2" d="M650 599 C730 565 791 554 850 563"></path><path class="land-line2" d="M310 166 C408 140 498 121 638 118"></path><path class="land-line2" d="M354 510 C464 540 564 560 701 520"></path><g transform="translate(26 68)"><rect class="land-node" height="56" rx="12" width="118"></rect><text class="land-label" x="59" y="24">CRM</text><text class="land-small" x="59" y="4