nd"><div class="text"><div class="num">01</div><h2>The Modeling Trap</h2><p class="lead">The model describes how work is expected to happen.</p><p class="copy">Actual execution reveals the paths, retries, manual steps and exceptions that the model often misses.</p></div><div class="visual"><svg height="100%" viewbox="0 0 720 340" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><defs><filter filterunits="userSpaceOnUse" height="115%" id="cardShadow" width="110%" x="-5%" y="-5%"><fedropshadow dx="0" dy="8" flood-color="#0B192C" flood-opacity="0.06" stddeviation="12"></fedropshadow></filter><marker id="arrowGray" markerheight="8" markerwidth="8" orient="auto" refx="6" refy="4"><path d="M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z" fill="#94A3B8"></path></marker><marker id="arrowOrange" markerheight="8" markerwidth="8" orient="auto" refx="6" refy="4"><path d="M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z" fill="#F97316"></path></marker><marker id="arrowPurple" markerheight="8" markerwidth="8" orient="auto" refx="6" refy="4"><path d="M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z" fill="#5E17EB"></path></marker></defs><rect fill="#FFFFFF" filter="url(#cardShadow)" height="320" rx="14" stroke="#E2E8F0" stroke-width="1.5" width="700" x="10" y="10"></rect><g transform="translate(40, 35)"><rect fill="#F1F5F9" height="22" rx="4" width="100" x="0" y="0"></rect><text fill="#64748B" font-family="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="1.2" text-anchor="middle" x="50" y="15">INTENDED</text><g transform="translate(40, 45)"><rect fill="#F8FAFC" height="38" rx="8" stroke="#CBD5E1" stroke-width="1.5" width="120" x="0" y="0"></rect><text fill="#1E293B" font-family="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" x="60" y="24">Order</text><line marker-end="url(#arrowGray)" stroke="#94A3B8" stroke-dasharray="4,4" stroke-width="2" x1="120" x2="190" y1="19" y2="19"></line><rect fill="#F8FAFC" height="38" rx="8" stroke="#CBD5E1"