/rect><text fill="#475569" font-family="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" x="222" y="21">Queue</text><line marker-end="url(#arrowOrange)" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.5" x1="255" x2="280" y1="17" y2="17"></line><rect fill="#FFF7ED" height="34" rx="6" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.5" width="105" x="285" y="0"></rect><text fill="#C2410C" font-family="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" x="337" y="21">Manual Review</text><path d="M 337,0 C 337,-25 222,-25 222,-3" fill="none" marker-end="url(#arrowOrange)" stroke="#F97316" stroke-dasharray="3,3" stroke-width="1.5"></path><rect fill="#FFF7ED" height="15" rx="3" width="42" x="260" y="-30"></rect><text fill="#EA580C" font-family="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="9" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="281" y="-19">RETRY</text><line marker-end="url(#arrowGray)" stroke="#64748B" stroke-width="1.5" x1="390" x2="415" y1="17" y2="17"></line><rect fill="#FFFFFF" height="34" rx="6" stroke="#64748B" stroke-width="1.2" width="65" x="420" y="0"></rect><text fill="#475569" font-family="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" x="452" y="21">Batch</text><line marker-end="url(#arrowPurple)" stroke="#5E17EB" stroke-width="1.5" x1="485" x2="520" y1="17" y2="17"></line><rect fill="#5E17EB" height="34" rx="6" stroke="#5E17EB" stroke-width="1.5" width="95" x="525" y="0"></rect><text fill="#FFFFFF" font-family="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" x="572" y="21">Settlement</text></g></g></svg></div></article><article class="band reverse"><div class="text"><div class="num">02</div><h2>Disconnected Realities</h2><p class="lead">Different teams see different parts of the same workflow.</p><p class="copy">Operations, engineering and architecture each have a valid view. The missing piece is the relationship between those views.</p></div><div class="visual"><svg height="100%" viewbox="0 0 760 560" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><defs><filter filterunits="userSpaceOnUse" height="115%" id="boxShadow" width="110%" x="-5%" y="-5%"><fedropshadow dx="0" dy="6" flood-color="#0B192C" flood-opacity="0.06" stddeviation="10"></fedropshadow></filter><marker id="spineArrow" markerheight="8" markerwidth="8" orient="auto" refx="4" refy="4"><path d="M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z" fill="#5E17EB"></path></marker><marker id="retryArrowV" markerheight="8" markerwidth="8" orient="auto" refx="4" refy="4"><path d="M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z" fill="#F97316"></path></marker></defs><rect fill="#FFFFFF" filter="url(#boxShadow)" height="540" rx="16" stroke="#E2E8F0" stroke-width="1.5" width="740" x="10" y="10"></rect><g transform="translate(40, 45)"><rect fill="#F8FAFC" height="110" rx="10" stroke="#CBD5E1" stroke-width="1.2" width="270" x="0" y="0"></rect><rect fill="#FEE2E2" height="20" rx="4" width="95" x="16" y="14"></rect><text fill="#DC2626" font-family="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="10" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="0.5" text-anchor="middle" x="63" y="28">OPERATIONS</text><text fill="#0B192C" font-family="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="700" x="16" y="58">Delay &amp; Rework</text><text fill="#64748B" font-family="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="11" x="16" y="76">Sees delays, queues</text><text fill="#64748B" font-family="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="11" x="16" y="92">&amp; rework.</text><circle cx="238" cy="55" fill="#FFFFFF" r="18" stroke="#DC2626" stroke-width="1.5"></circle><path d="M228,55 C231,50 245,50 248,55 C245,60 231,60 228,55 Z" fil