e.</tspan>"</text></g></svg></div></article><article class="band"><div class="text"><div class="num">03</div><h2>The Actionability Gap</h2><p class="lead">Static relationships explain what is connected.</p><p class="copy">Execution context adds what is happening now, what path was taken, what it depended on and where behavior changed.</p></div><div class="visual"><svg height="100%" viewbox="0 0 760 360" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><defs><filter height="115%" id="cardShadowU" width="110%" x="-5%" y="-5%"><fedropshadow dx="0" dy="6" flood-color="#0B192C" flood-opacity="0.06" stddeviation="10"></fedropshadow></filter></defs><rect fill="#FFFFFF" filter="url(#cardShadowU)" height="340" rx="16" stroke="#E2E8F0" stroke-width="1.5" width="740" x="10" y="10"></rect><g transform="translate(35, 30)"><rect fill="#F1F5F9" height="22" rx="4" width="152" x="0" y="0"></rect><text fill="#64748B" font-family="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="10" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="1" text-anchor="middle" x="76" y="15">STATIC RELATIONSHIPS</text><g transform="translate(10, 45)"><rect fill="#F8FAFC" height="36" rx="6" stroke="#CBD5E1" stroke-width="1.2" width="110" x="0" y="0"></rect><text fill="#475569" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" x="55" y="22">Customer (Entity)</text><rect fill="#F8FAFC" height="36" rx="6" stroke="#CBD5E1" stroke-width="1.2" width="110" x="160" y="0"></rect><text fill="#475569" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" x="215" y="22">Order (Schema)</text><rect fill="#F8FAFC" height="36" rx="6" stroke="#CBD5E1" stroke-width="1.2" width="110" x="0" y="85"></rect><text fill="#475569" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" x="55" y="107">Service (API)</text><rect fill="#F8FAFC" height="36" rx="6" stroke="#CBD5E1" stroke-width="1.2" width="110" x="160" y="85"></rect><text fill="#47556